#9701
Red Rock~
   You stand in front of a huge rock in the middle of nowhere.  Looking south
the path in the forest continues.  There are three big openings in the cliff,
one in each of the other three directions.  On each side of the cave is a blood
red stone pillar.  Over each opening is a picture of a sword painted to the
cliff.  The west opening bears a black sword, the north has two crossed swords,
black and white.  The last hole in the wall to the east has a white sword over
it.  You can see a sign bolted to the cliff on on the northern wall.  This fog
almost saturates the three tunnels.    
~
