#9726
The Bath~
   A strange, but pleasing smell rises into the air here.  Even though this
bath has been deserted for centuries, there are still old mosaics embedded into
the tiles.  The churning sounds of water can be heard coming from the old stone
pipes that line the walls.  One can only imagine what this would have looked
like when it was well kept.  What was that sound?  Is someone here splashing
around in the water?  No, it must be your imagination...  Or is it?  The only
available exit is back to the north, and into the canyon.    
~
