#9727
The Bar~
   This bar has taken a beating over the years.  At least you think it's a bar,
a large stone counter, with what looks like stone stools lined up against it.
There is broken furniture and remnants of wood and stone lying all around the
floor.  It's very apparent that even old civilizations had their fair share of
bar brawls, much like your last one.  The only exit from here is back south to
the canyon.    
~
