   Which way were you headed?  The air feels like a heavy blanket upon your
chest while walking around.  It must be all this red sand and the bright rays
from the sun that intensify it.  The stone benches that line this place could
seat thousands you believe.  It looks as though you might find an exit to the
north, south or east.  However, the sun might just be playing tricks on your
eyes.    
~
