#9756
Arena~
   This is the northwestern corner of this old arena.  A large iron door stands
in the northern wall.  There is a sign over the top of the door, but the
blowing sand and sun have aged it too much to be read or understood.  There is
an intangible evil that seems to radiate from behind the door.  This strange
presence has your curiosity peaked, but do you open to find out what's behind
it?  The only exits from here are south and east, or through the strange iron
door.    
~
