#9757
The Gladiators~
   This place reeks of sweat and blood, even though centuries have passed since
the last gladiator walked through that door.  This must be where gladiators
awaited their fate in that sun baked arena of blowing sand.  There is a doorway
west, however it's been blocked by a pile of debris and large rocks.  The only
exit is to the south into the arena.    
~
