#9764
Smelly Tunnel~
   Upon entering this room you are overwhelmed by the stench of the animals
that used to reside here.  You would be correct in thinking that the way north
leads to the stables.  Even though the environment was harsh in the arena it
seems all the more appealing now.  There are some familiar tracks on the ground
and others you've never seen before.  A feeling of foreboding comes over you to
press onward, but perhaps you have cause to.  To the south is the door to the
arena, the north holds more foul odors.    
~
