Smelly End~
   You breathe a small sigh of relief as some of the smell starts to waft away
on the breeze coming from the west.  To the north there is a large iron door,
and to the south a small tunnel.  The east leads back to the horrendous stench
of the animal pens.  A dim glow seems to eminate from the western exit, but
anything has to be better than that stench to the east.  Finally, maybe you'll
find some fresh air to breathe.    
~
