#9778
The Bottom~
   The air brushes past your face as you fall to the bottom of the well.  
Eventually the darkness subsides and you wake up covered in debris, rocks, and
dust.  The old iron bars holding the ladder must have snapped on the way down.
You feel quite fortunate to have escaped with your life after such a
thoughtless act of trying to climb down here.  As you study the surroundings
you feel that a second climb to the top might result in your immediate death.
  
~
