#9794
Harmony~
   Finally, you have reached the ends of those horrid mists.  Strange
inscriptions and runes cover the floor, walls, and ceiling of this cave.  This
room emits a very powerful aura which is nearly tangible.  There are mosaics
and paintings that line the walls, each depicting a different battle.  You
notice within each of them that strangely garbed men are fighting without
weapons.  Some of them depict a good nature, while others show their darker
side.  This rooms seems to hold the meaning of harmony in every sense.  The
only visible exit is through the hole in the east wall, and back into the
mists.    
~
